{"id":"einzig","lemma":"einzig","pos":"adj","rank":285,"glosses":["only, sole","unique"],"ipa":"/ˈaɪ̯nt͡sɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c5/De-einzig.ogg/De-einzig.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Einzig wichtig ist, dass du lebst.","en":"The only thing that matters is that you are alive.","words":[null,{"g":"important"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"a state in which…","l":"Leben"}]},{"text":"Das ist einzig und allein deine Entscheidung.","en":"It's entirely your decision.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"alone"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},{"g":"decision"}]},{"text":"Einzig Tom wollte nicht gehen.","en":"Only Tom didn't want to go.","words":[null,null,{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to go, to walk"}]},{"text":"Es ist die einzig mögliche Schlussfolgerung.","en":"It's the only possible conclusion.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"possible","l":"möglich"},{"g":"conclusion"}]},{"text":"Tom ist mein einzig wirklicher Freund.","en":"Tom is my only real friend.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"really, actually","l":"wirklich"},{"g":"friend"}]}]}